{{define "content"}}
<div class="container section anim">
  <h1>Night harbour</h1>
  <figure class="anim-stage">
    <img id="scene" src="/static/harbour-night.svg" width="960" height="540" alt="A sailing boat crosses a harbour at night, with a lighthouse, waves, stars and the moon">
  </figure>
  <p class="anim-note">A boat sails across the bay, the lighthouse sweeps its beam, the waves roll and the stars twinkle. The scene is one SVG file with SMIL animation. It loops forever and needs no script. The boat needs 16 seconds to cross the bay, and the beam sweeps every 5 seconds.</p>
</div>
{{end}}
